    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom1_Text_RaidCyrusThreeLines",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The door below is fed from\n",
        "three places. Three lines.\r",
        "I can feel them, like seams.\r",
        "Cut all three, and it falls."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom1_Text_RaidCyrusGoAhead",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I'll go ahead to the door\n",
        "and read it. You find the lines."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom1_Text_RaidPoketchBuzzes",
      "en_US": "The Poketch buzzes."
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonRuinsRoom1_Text_RaidRuthReadings",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Can you hear me? I've got the\n",
        "shard readings up!\r",
        "Three strong sources, deeper in.\n",
        "And one huge one at the bottom.\r",
        "That has to be the vault.\r",
        "...Be careful. Please."
